1
00:00:00,502 --> 00:00:05,052
(Howard:)And now, all the rings
are magically linked together.

2
00:00:08,677 --> 00:00:12,557
My fiancée's wearing a magic ring too.
It made all my money disappear.

3
00:00:15,601 --> 00:00:16,851
Oh, oh, right.

4
00:00:21,690 --> 00:00:26,190
(Bernadette:)And now, the Great Howdini's
next miraculous illusion.

5
00:00:27,279 --> 00:00:29,069
(Child:)When are we gonna have cake?

6
00:00:29,281 --> 00:00:32,741
(Bernadette:)After you've been thoroughly amazed.

7
00:00:34,411 --> 00:00:36,411
(Child:)But we want cake now.

8
00:00:36,622 --> 00:00:39,662
(Bernadette:)Well, you're not getting
cake right now, capiche?

9
00:00:42,002 --> 00:00:44,462
Heh, heh, okay, okay.

10
00:00:46,006 --> 00:00:48,546
(Howard:)Now my lovely assistant
is going to bring me...

11
00:00:48,717 --> 00:00:52,597
(Howard:)- ...an ordinary pitcher of milk.
- I know how you do that trick.

12
00:00:52,804 --> 00:00:54,384
(Bernadette:)Do you know how to pipe down?

13
00:00:55,932 --> 00:01:01,102
(Howard:)Okay, we're going to
roll up this newspaper.

